commit b7415a08
author: cdvankammen
date: 2026-10-22 15:41:21 -0600
subject: fix(providers): P3 UX improvements — error states, dead code removal

- Add fetchError state + retry UI to providers list page
- Add fetchError state + retry UI to provider detail page
- Enhance test failure messages with actual error details
- Remove dead WEB_COOKIE_PROVIDERS import and commented code
- Remove unused /api/init/route.js endpoint

All changes in isolated worktree to avoid concurrent worker conflicts.
Build failures (open-sse/executors/9router.js, open-sse/utils/responseValidator.js)
are pre-existing issues in main repo, not caused by these P3 fixes.


